---
source: tests/explain_snapshots.rs
description: "-- star around lineitem with two dimension filters\nSELECT l_orderkey, l_linenumber\nFROM lineitem, part, orders\nWHERE l_partkey = p_partkey\n  AND l_orderkey = o_orderkey\n  AND p_brand = 'Brand#44'\n  AND o_orderstatus = 'O'"
expression: rendered
---
Project [#0.0, #0.2]
  Join on=[#0.0 = #2.0]
    Join on=[#0.1 = #1.0]
      Project [#0.0, #0.1, #0.2]
        Scan #0
      Filter (#1.2 = 'Brand#44')
        Project [#1.0, #1.2]
          Scan #1
    Filter (#2.2 = 'O')
      Project [#2.0, #2.2]
        Scan #2
